    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d215">

                <pb facs="0257" n="141" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg141"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/957.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                            France to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 20, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The commission has agreed and adjourned. Your June 20 arrived most
                    opportunely.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Herrick.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
